  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SAAF Core Support 2017-2020</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safe Abortion Action Fund is a mulit-donor funding mechanism which supports in-country intiiatives for increasing access to safe abortion services. They provide small flexible grants to local NGOs to do policy advocacy, innovations in service delivery and research. SAAF focuses on the needs of the most marginalised and vulnerable girls and women, within a comprehensive package of sexual and reproductive health.</narrative>
  </description>
